WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.589
A news feed hands you a hundred headlines, and leaves you to work out what they add up to.

2
00:00:08.221 --> 00:00:12.829
This page starts with a brief, written by a model from the day's coverage.

3
00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:19.159
Open its sources, and you get every article it was written from, and what each one contributed.

4
00:00:19.672 --> 00:00:24.323
Below it, the tone of the coverage, counted: positive, neutral and negative.

5
00:00:24.828 --> 00:00:30.631
Open any story for a digest: the key points, why it matters, and the tickers it names.

6
00:00:31.135 --> 00:00:34.250
finplatform. The news, and what it adds up to.
